    "text": "I’m Marzia.\nI make ideas real.\n\nI’m a design engineer working between an idea and a real product.\n\nI’m most useful when things are still a little unclear.\n\nFrom the first question to the final detail.\n\nI figure out what a product should do, design how it should feel, and get close enough to the code to make sure the idea survives implementation.\n\nI care about the small interaction details, and whether the thing actually works.\n\nCuriosity usually becomes a prototype.\n\nLately, I’m exploring what changes when AI becomes part of the product itself, and how people and AI make decisions together.\n\nMostly, I like making things. If an idea stays with me, I build it."
